JOB 1 and JOB 2 are independent: a HOLD or failure in one never stops the other, except REFUSE 1 to 3 which stop both. A text whose figure fails its source, or a duplicate found, holds only that ticket (the record then says so). A write that is not on the closed lists, or a second create for the same item: STOP before it. Any value of the cookie visible in a tool result: say "a value was shown" in STATUS (never repeat it), keep going with the redaction, and put the event first in FOR TUESDAY.

